# Steven's intro — his own dictated words (2026-11-24), published verbatim, spellings and all. Do not copyedit.
intro_text='The whole thing started with a question from a friend.  From Nerd Heaven, and a few apps built frankly out of both curiosity and bordem.  An earlier set of playing around had even been incorported in a couple of cases literally from a bordeom file.   Then came the workshop ideas and deep dives into subjects as they suggested themselves usually relating or being lead to by others.  The results no include rocketry, thrust, electronics and most recently math deep dives into some of the most vexing problems students and the teachers trying to teach them run into.  The result is what you see today and continues to be built as the Wild Goose Flies.'
intro_block='<aside class="curator-intro"><p class="eyebrow">How this started</p><p>'+esc(intro_text)+'</p><p class="byline">— Steven Powell</p></aside>'
